// Cyrus asset catalog tools in a build (catalog v2: lib/cyrus/library/v2/tools.ts). OFF unless the portal sends a
// `catalog` offer, which it only does with CYRUS_CATALOG_TOOLS=1 and an index configured (lib/cyrus/library/v2/build-offer.ts).
